<title>USA: ACC picks Laniak as chairman.</title>
<headline>ACC picks Laniak as chairman.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.Y. 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>ACC Corp said Monday its board elected David Laniak as chairman to succeed company co-founder Richard Aab, who is resigning to pursue other business opportunities. The appointment is effective October 8, the company said.</p>
<p>Aab has been chairman of ACC since 1982 and was chief executive from 1983 to October 1995. Laniak joined as chief executive last October and has been on the board since 1989, the company said.</p>
